  "summary": {
    "plain": "XENON100 also searched its data for axions and axion-like particles and found no signal.",
    "technical": "Axio-electric effect in liquid xenon: solar-axion search rejects g_Ae larger than 7.7e-12 (90% CL), best limit to date at publication; DFSZ and KSVZ QCD axions heavier than 0.3 eV/c^2 and 80 eV/c^2 excluded; for axion-like particles as all of the dark matter, g_Ae lower than 1e-12 (90% CL) for 1 to 40 keV/c^2."
  },
